WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:02.555
Roxy flew after Lily Zusk.

2
00:00:02.556 --> 00:00:07.809
Lily ran into a store. Roxy followed her inside.

3
00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:10.095
But Lily wasn't there.

4
00:00:10.096 --> 00:00:13.085
"Over here!" Lily called.

5
00:00:13.086 --> 00:00:14.517
Roxy spun around.

6
00:00:14.518 --> 00:00:16.904
Now Lily was across the street!

7
00:00:16.905 --> 00:00:18.763
Roxy flew back outside.

8
00:00:18.764 --> 00:00:22.180
A bus zoomed by. Lily disappeared!

9
00:00:22.181 --> 00:00:25.062
A moment later she was on the roof of a building.

10
00:00:25.063 --> 00:00:28.926
Roxy gasped. "How did Lily get up there?"

11
00:00:28.927 --> 00:00:32.981
Roxy flew up to the roof. Lily was gone!

12
00:00:32.982 --> 00:00:36.941
Roxy saw her run down the street and into the technology hub.

13
00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:40.324
Roxy followed her.

14
00:00:40.325 --> 00:00:42.907
The building was still crowded.

15
00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:47.353
"Ugh," Roxy said. "How will I find Lily?"

16
00:00:47.354 --> 00:00:50.027
Roxy looked down at the green floor.

17
00:00:50.028 --> 00:00:51.530
She tapped her chin.

18
00:00:51.531 --> 00:00:53.845
Lily Zusk moved so fast.

19
00:00:53.846 --> 00:00:57.444
It didn't make sense.

20
00:00:57.445 --> 00:01:00.911
"Why can't I catch her?" Roxy thought.

21
00:01:00.912 --> 00:01:05.100
She looked at the big painting's colorful shapes.

22
00:01:05.101 --> 00:01:08.745
"That's odd." Roxy scratched her head.

23
00:01:08.746 --> 00:01:12.954
"I thought that painting had lots of lines."

24
00:01:12.955 --> 00:01:15.537
She looked down at the floor again.

25
00:01:15.538 --> 00:01:20.897
"And this floor wasn't green. I remember—it was blue!"

26
00:01:20.898 --> 00:01:23.963
She looked out the window. She saw a bank.

27
00:01:23.964 --> 00:01:26.980
But it wasn't True Savings Bank!

28
00:01:26.981 --> 00:01:29.591
"This isn't real!" Roxy said.

29
00:01:29.592 --> 00:01:32.626
"Where am I? What's going . . . ?"

30
00:01:32.627 --> 00:01:34.617
Everything around her faded.

31
00:01:34.618 --> 00:01:37.415
Now Roxy was inside a sphere.

32
00:01:37.416 --> 00:01:40.030
She didn't see any windows or doors.

33
00:01:40.031 --> 00:01:45.877
Roxy groaned. "This must be a virtual reality room.

34
00:01:45.878 --> 00:01:50.047
I'm in a big video game!" She made a fist.

35
00:01:50.048 --> 00:01:54.689
"I teleported here from that booth! Lily Zusk tricked me!"

36
00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.803
Just then she heard footsteps.

37
00:01:56.804 --> 00:01:59.355
"We stole more money, boss!"

38
00:01:59.356 --> 00:02:01.379
Two men entered the laboratory.

39
00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:04.192
They dropped huge money bags near the sphere.

40
00:02:04.193 --> 00:02:10.275
"Wonderful!" Lily said. "Tomorrow we'll steal everything in the technology hub."

41
00:02:10.276 --> 00:02:13.937
One man grinned. "I'm glad we don't have to worry about—"

42
00:02:13.938 --> 00:02:18.285
Ka-boom! The sphere blew apart. Roxy jumped out.

43
00:02:18.286 --> 00:02:21.337
"Rocket Girl!" Lily shouted.

44
00:02:21.338 --> 00:02:23.781
Lily's crew put up their hands.

45
00:02:23.782 --> 00:02:25.604
"I surrender!"

46
00:02:25.605 --> 00:02:27.261
"Me too!"

47
00:02:27.262 --> 00:02:31.686
"Not me!" Lily jumped into a booth.

48
00:02:31.687 --> 00:02:35.488
Roxy fired her eye laser beams. Whiz-hoo!

49
00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:38.254
They bounced off the booth and hit the computer.

50
00:02:38.255 --> 00:02:40.150
Sparks flew from it.

51
00:02:40.151 --> 00:02:44.665
Lily jumped back out. "Hooray! I got away from—"

52
00:02:44.666 --> 00:02:47.238
She saw Rocket Girl and gulped.

53
00:02:47.239 --> 00:02:51.483
"Ugh! I'm still in the laboratory!"

54
00:02:51.484 --> 00:02:55.802
Roxy folded her arms. "Yep!"

55
00:02:55.803 --> 00:02:59.310
Police arrived and arrested Lily and her crew.

56
00:02:59.311 --> 00:03:02.992
"Nice work, Rocket Girl," Detective Smith said.

57
00:03:02.993 --> 00:03:04.967
"But where were you all day?

58
00:03:04.968 --> 00:03:07.443
Mayor Bloom tried to call you."

59
00:03:07.444 --> 00:03:09.283
He gave her a funny look.

60
00:03:09.284 --> 00:03:12.620
"What were you doing? Playing video games?"

61
00:03:12.621 --> 00:03:21.923
Roxy laughed. "Actually, Detective, yes. I was!"

